      "headword": "הִין",
      "ref": "BDB, הִין",
      "preview": "הִין: him, medida de líquidos; recipiente com essa capacidade.",
      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">הִין</span></big>  <strong>substantivo masculino.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Leviticus 19:36\" href=\"/Leviticus.19.36\">Lv 19:36</a></sup> <strong>him</strong>, medida de líquidos <strong>(</strong>𝔊 εἵν (ἵν; 𝔊L ἵν); mas χοῦς <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 19:36\" href=\"/Leviticus.19.36\">Lv 19:36</a>; grego ἵνιον, medida egípcia, = <em>sextarius</em>, segundo Böckh<sup>Metrol. Unters. 244</sup> cf. Brandis<sup>Münz- Mass- & Gewichtswesen 29, 30</sup>; o him hebraico (6,06 litros) era, contudo, muito maior do que o him egípcio (0,456 litro), ver Hultsch<sup>Metrol., Tab. xxi. p. 714, & pp. 368, 450 ff.</sup>; ver ainda Ri<sup>HWB</sup> Smith<sup>Dict. Bib.</sup> E. Meyer<sup>Gesch. i. 228</sup><strong>)</strong>—estado absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">הִין</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 30:24\" href=\"/Exodus.30.24\">Ex 30:24</a> + 4 vezes <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 45\" href=\"/Ezekiel.45\">Ez 45</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 46\" href=\"/Ezekiel.46\">46</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">הַהִין</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 29:40\" href=\"/Exodus.29.40\">Ex 29:40</a><sup>(×2)</sup> + 14 vezes; estado construto <span dir=\"rtl\">הִין</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 19:36\" href=\"/Leviticus.19.36\">Lv 19:36</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  medida, usada para a quantidade de água para beber <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 4:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.4.11\">Ez 4:11</a>; geralmente em conexão com as ofertas: <strong>a.</strong>  de azeite usado com a oferta de cereais <a data-ref=\"Exodus 29:40\" href=\"/Exodus.29.40\">Ex 29:40</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 15:4\" href=\"/Numbers.15.4\">Nu 15:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 15:6\" href=\"/Numbers.15.6\">6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 15:9\" href=\"/Numbers.15.9\">9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 28:5\" href=\"/Numbers.28.5\">28:5</a> (todos P), <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 45:24\" href=\"/Ezekiel.45.24\">Ez 45:24</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 46:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.46.5\">46:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 46:6\" href=\"/Ezekiel.46.6\">6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 46:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.46.11\">11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 46:14\" href=\"/Ezekiel.46.14\">14</a>;—geralmente ¼ de him para 1/10 de efa (de oferta de cereais); <a data-ref=\"Numbers 15:6\" href=\"/Numbers.15.6\">Nu 15:6</a> 1/3; versículo <a data-ref=\"Numbers 15:9\" href=\"/Numbers.15.9\">9</a> 1/2; em Ez um him (inteiro), exceto <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 46:14\" href=\"/Ezekiel.46.14\">46:14</a> 1/3 de him para 1/6 de efa. <strong>b.</strong>  usado na mistura do óleo da unção <a data-ref=\"Exodus 30:24\" href=\"/Exodus.30.24\">Ex 30:24</a>. <strong>c.</strong>  de vinho como libação <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 23:13\" href=\"/Leviticus.23.13\">Lv 23:13</a> (H); nos demais casos P, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 29:40\" href=\"/Exodus.29.40\">Ex 29:40</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 15:5\" href=\"/Numbers.15.5\">Nu 15:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 28:14\" href=\"/Numbers.28.14\">28:14</a> (todos 1/4 de him) <a data-ref=\"Numbers 15:7\" href=\"/Numbers.15.7\">15:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 28:14\" href=\"/Numbers.28.14\">28:14</a> (ambos 1/3 de him), <a data-ref=\"Numbers 15:10\" href=\"/Numbers.15.10\">15:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 28:14\" href=\"/Numbers.28.14\">28:14</a> (ambos ½ him; todos com 1/10 a 3/10 de efa no caso da oferta de cereais). <strong>d.</strong>  uma vez de <span dir=\"rtl\">שֵׁכָר</span> como libação <a data-ref=\"Numbers 28:7\" href=\"/Numbers.28.7\">Nu 28:7</a> (P; ¼ de him; cf. Di).<br><strong>2.</strong>  recipiente com a capacidade de um him <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 19:36\" href=\"/Leviticus.19.36\">Lv 19:36</a> (H) <span dir=\"rtl\">הִין־צֶדֶק</span> <em>um him justo</em> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מֹאזְנֵי צ׳</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אַבְנֵי־צ׳</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵיפַת צ׳</span>).—O him = 1/6 de bato segundo Josefo<sup>Ant</sup> iii. 8, 3; 9, 4, = 6,06 litros (Hultsch<sup>l.c.</sup>), ver ii. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, בַּת⁴\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_בַּת⁴\">בַּת</a>. Quanto à ordem das palavras nas passagens acima, note-se que <span dir=\"rtl\">הִין</span> (<span dir=\"rtl\">רְבִיעִת ה׳</span> etc.) está geralmente em aposição ao líquido medido e ou o precede <a data-ref=\"Exodus 29:40\" href=\"/Exodus.29.40\">Ex 29:40</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 15:4\" href=\"/Numbers.15.4\">Nu 15:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 28:14\" href=\"/Numbers.28.14\">28:14</a>, ou, mais frequentemente, o segue <a data-ref=\"Exodus 30:24\" href=\"/Exodus.30.24\">Ex 30:24</a> + 10 vezes; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 28:7\" href=\"/Numbers.28.7\">Nu 28:7</a> estão em orações diferentes; em <a data-ref=\"Exodus 29:40\" href=\"/Exodus.29.40\">Ex 29:40</a> encontramos <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּשֶׁמֶן</span> … <span dir=\"rtl\">רֶבַע הַהִין</span>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Numbers 15:6\" href=\"/Numbers.15.6\">Nu 15:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 15:9\" href=\"/Numbers.15.9\">9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 28:5\" href=\"/Numbers.28.5\">28:5</a>;—<a data-ref=\"Numbers 28:14\" href=\"/Numbers.28.14\">Nu 28:14</a> é peculiar: <span dir=\"rtl\">וְנִסְכֵּיהֶם חֲצִי הַהִין יִהְיֶה לַפָּר וּשְׁלִישִׁת הַהִין לָאַיִל וּרְבִיעִת הַהִין לַכֶּבֶשׂ יָ֑יִן</span> (<span dir=\"rtl\">יין</span> somente no final).",
