      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">הַמְּדָתָא</span></big>  <strong>nome próprio masculino.</strong> pai de Hamã <strong>(</strong>persa <em>mâh</em>, <em>lua</em> Öt; 𝔊 Ἁμαδαθου (sempre genitivo); em grego talvez Μαδάτης [Μαδάτας, Μαδέτης], cf. Xenofonte<sup>Cyr, v. 3. 41</sup> Diodoro<sup>xvii, 67</sup> Pott<sup>ZMG 1859, 424</sup><strong>)</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">הַמְּדָתָא הָֽאֲגָגִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Esther 3:1\" href=\"/Esther.3.1\">Est 3:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Esther 3:10\" href=\"/Esther.3.10\">10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Esther 8:5\" href=\"/Esther.8.5\">8:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Esther 9:24\" href=\"/Esther.9.24\">9:24</a>; sem <span dir=\"rtl\">האגגי</span> <a data-ref=\"Esther 9:10\" href=\"/Esther.9.10\">9:10</a>.",
