      "preview": "הָמָה: murmurar, rosnar, rugir, estar tumultuado.",
      "html": "† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">הָמָה</span>]</big></big>  <strong>verbo.</strong> murmurar, rosnar, rugir, ser ruidoso <strong>(</strong>𝔗 <span dir=\"rtl\">הֲמָא</span>, mas raro, e talvez não genuinamente aramaico; cf. árabe <span dir=\"rtl\">هَمْهَمَ</span> <em>murmurar</em><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  perfeito, 3.ª pessoa do plural masculino <span dir=\"rtl\">הָמוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 46:7\" href=\"/Psalms.46.7\">ψ 46:7</a> + 2 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">וְהָמוּ</span> consecutivo <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 5:22\" href=\"/Jeremiah.5.22\">Je 5:22</a> + 2 vezes; imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">יֶהֱמֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 6:23\" href=\"/Jeremiah.6.23\">Jr 6:23</a> + 3 vezes; 2.ª pessoa do singular feminino <span dir=\"rtl\">תֶּהֱמִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 42:12\" href=\"/Psalms.42.12\">ψ 42:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 43:5\" href=\"/Psalms.43.5\">43:5</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַתֶּהֱמִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 42:6\" href=\"/Psalms.42.6\">42:6</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶהֱמֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 55:18\" href=\"/Psalms.55.18\">55:18</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶהֱמָ֑יָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 77:4\" href=\"/Psalms.77.4\">77:4</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יֶהֱמוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 46:4\" href=\"/Psalms.46.4\">46:4</a> + 3 vezes; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיֶּהֱמוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 51:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.51.15\">Is 51:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:35\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.35\">Je 31:35</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יֶהֱמָיוּ֑ן</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 39:7\" href=\"/Psalms.39.7\">ψ 39:7</a> + 2 vezes; 1.ª pessoa do plural <span dir=\"rtl\">נֶהֱמֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 59:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.59.11\">Is 59:11</a>; infinitivo <span dir=\"rtl\">הֲמוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 17:12\" href=\"/Isaiah.17.12\">Is 17:12</a>; particípio <span dir=\"rtl\">הֹמֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 20:1\" href=\"/Proverbs.20.1\">Pr 20:1</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 4:19\" href=\"/Jeremiah.4.19\">Je 4:19</a>; feminino <span dir=\"rtl\">הוֹמָה</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1:41\" href=\"/I_Kings.1.41\">1 K 1:41</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">הֹמִיָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 7:11\" href=\"/Proverbs.7.11\">Pr 7:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 9:13\" href=\"/Proverbs.9.13\">9:13</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">הוֹמִיָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 22:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.22.2\">Is 22:2</a>; plural feminino <span dir=\"rtl\">הֹמִיּוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 1:21\" href=\"/Proverbs.1.21\">Pr 1:21</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">הֹמוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 7:16\" href=\"/Ezekiel.7.16\">Ez 7:16</a> (Co <span dir=\"rtl\">הַמָּוֶת</span> cf. 𝔊 𝔖);— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>rosnar</em> como cão <span dir=\"rtl\">כַּכָּ֑לֶב</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 59:7\" href=\"/Psalms.59.7\">ψ 59:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 59:15\" href=\"/Psalms.59.15\">15</a>, sujeito homens ímpios; <em>gemer</em> (em angústia, lamentação), como ursos <span dir=\"rtl\">כַּדֹּבִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 59:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.59.11\">Is 59:11</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">הגה כיונה</span>); de pombas (também em símile) <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 7:16\" href=\"/Ezekiel.7.16\">Ez 7:16</a> cf. Da (se a leitura for verdadeira, ver acima). <strong>2.</strong>  <em>murmurar</em>, figuradamente da alma <span dir=\"rtl\">(נֶפֶשׁ)</span> em desânimo <a data-ref=\"Psalms 42:6\" href=\"/Psalms.42.6\">ψ 42:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 42:12\" href=\"/Psalms.42.12\">12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 43:5\" href=\"/Psalms.43.5\">43:5</a>; em oração <a data-ref=\"Psalms 55:18\" href=\"/Psalms.55.18\">55:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 77:4\" href=\"/Psalms.77.4\">77:4</a> (ambos ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אָשִׂיחָה</span>); também sujeito <span dir=\"rtl\">מֵעִים</span>, da <em>comoção</em> de compaixão ou simpatia profundamente sentida, seguido de <span dir=\"rtl\">לְ</span> da pessoa de quem se tem compaixão, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:20\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.20\">Je 31:20</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">רחם ארחמנו</span>), seguido de <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span>, <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 5:4\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.5.4\">Ct 5:4</a>; ainda <span dir=\"rtl\">כַּכִּנּוֹר</span>, <em>como a lira</em> (<em>cítara</em>) <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 16:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.16.11\">Is 16:11</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">כַּחֲלִילִים</span>, <em>como flautas</em>, sujeito <span dir=\"rtl\">לֵב</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:36\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.36\">Je 48:36</a> (seguido de <span dir=\"rtl\">לְ</span>) versículo <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:36\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.36\">36</a> (seguido de <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶל</span>); cf. <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 4:19\" href=\"/Jeremiah.4.19\">Je 4:19</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">לִבִּי הֹמֶה־לִי</span>. <strong>3.</strong>  <em>rugir</em>, de ondas, sujeito <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּלִּים</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 5:22\" href=\"/Jeremiah.5.22\">Je 5:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:35\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.35\">31:35</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 51:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.51.15\">Is 51:15</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 46:4\" href=\"/Psalms.46.4\">ψ 46:4</a>; símile do rugido de multidões <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 17:12\" href=\"/Isaiah.17.12\">Is 17:12</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 6:23\" href=\"/Jeremiah.6.23\">Je 6:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 50:42\" href=\"/Jeremiah.50.42\">50:42</a>; metaforicamente <em>idem</em>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:55\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.55\">Je 51:55</a>; <em>estar tumultuado</em>, de povos <a data-ref=\"Psalms 46:7\" href=\"/Psalms.46.7\">ψ 46:7</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מָטוּ</span>); <a data-ref=\"Psalms 83:3\" href=\"/Psalms.83.3\">83:3</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">נָֽשְׂאוּ רֹאשׁ</span>). <strong>4.</strong>  <em>estar em comoção, agitar-se</em>, de cidade <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1:41\" href=\"/I_Kings.1.41\">1 K 1:41</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 22:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.22.2\">Is 22:2</a>; assim particípio feminino plural como substantivo <span dir=\"rtl\">רֹאשׁ הֹמִיּוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 1:21\" href=\"/Proverbs.1.21\">Pr 1:21</a> <em>cabeceira de ruas agitadas, movimentadas</em> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">פתתי שׁערים</span>); do homem, <span dir=\"rtl\">אַךְ־הֶבֶל יֶהֱמָי֑וּן</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 39:7\" href=\"/Psalms.39.7\">ψ 39:7</a> <em>certamente em vão se agitam</em> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אַךְ־בְּצֶלֶם יִתְהַלֶּךְ־אִישׁ</span>). <strong>5.</strong>  <em>ser ruidoso, turbulento</em>, como pelo vinho <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 9:15\" href=\"/Zechariah.9.15\">Zc 9:15</a> (mas leia-se talvez <span dir=\"rtl\">דָּמָם</span>, cf. Fi<sup>Hexapl. ii. 3, 1024</sup> Klo<sup>Th LZ, 1879, 564</sup> Sta<sup>ZAW 1881, 18</sup>); também particípio como adjetivo, de <span dir=\"rtl\">שֵׁכָר</span> (por metonímia) <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 20:1\" href=\"/Proverbs.20.1\">Pr 20:1</a>; de mulher desavergonhada <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 7:11\" href=\"/Proverbs.7.11\">Pr 7:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 9:13\" href=\"/Proverbs.9.13\">9:13</a>.",
