      "preview": "הָמַם: fazer ruído, mover ruidosamente, confundir, desbaratar.",
      "html": "† <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">הָמַם</span></big></big>  <strong>verbo: fazer ruído, mover ruidosamente, confundir, desbaratar (</strong>cf. [<a data-ref=\"BDB, הוּם\" href=\"/BDB,_הוּם\", dir=\"rtl\">הום</a>]<strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  perfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">וְהָמַם</span> consecutivo <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:28\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.28\">Is 28:28</a>; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">הֲמָמַ֫נִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:34\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.34\">Je 51:34</a> Qere (Ketiv <span dir=\"rtl\">הֲמָמָ֫נוּ</span>), <span dir=\"rtl\">הֲמָמָם</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 15:16\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.15.16\">2 Ch 15:16</a>; 1.ª pessoa do singular <span dir=\"rtl\">וְהַמֹּתִ֫י</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 23:27\" href=\"/Exodus.23.27\">Ex 23:27</a>; imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיָּ֫הָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 14:24\" href=\"/Exodus.14.24\">Ex 14:24</a> <a data-ref=\"Judges 4:15\" href=\"/Judges.4.15\">Ju 4:15</a>; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיְּהֻמֵּם</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:10\" href=\"/Joshua.10.10\">Jos 10:10</a> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 7:10\" href=\"/I_Samuel.7.10\">1 S 7:10</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:15\" href=\"/Psalms.18.15\">ψ 18:15</a> + <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:15\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.15\">2 S 22:15</a> Ketiv (indubitavelmente correto; Qere <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיָּהֹ֑ם</span>); 2.ª pessoa do singular masculino com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">וּתְהֻמֵּם</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 144:6\" href=\"/Psalms.144.6\">ψ 144:6</a>; infinitivo com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">לְהֻמָּם</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 2:15\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.2.15\">Dt 2:15</a> <a data-ref=\"Esther 9:24\" href=\"/Esther.9.24\">Est 9:24</a>;— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>mover ruidosamente</em>, transitivo, conduzir um carro na debulha <span dir=\"rtl\">ה׳ גִּלְגַּל עֶגְלָתוֹ וּפָרָשָׁיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 28:28\" href=\"/Isaiah.28.28\">Is 28:28</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">דושׁ</span>). <strong>2.</strong>  <em>confundir, desbaratar</em>, com acusativo <a data-ref=\"Exodus 14:24\" href=\"/Exodus.14.24\">Ex 14:24</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 23:27\" href=\"/Exodus.23.27\">23:27</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:10\" href=\"/Joshua.10.10\">Jos 10:10</a> <a data-ref=\"Judges 4:15\" href=\"/Judges.4.15\">Ju 4:15</a> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 7:10\" href=\"/I_Samuel.7.10\">1 S 7:10</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:15\" href=\"/Psalms.18.15\">ψ 18:15</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:15\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.15\">2 S 22:15</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">הפיץ</span>), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 144:6\" href=\"/Psalms.144.6\">ψ 144:6</a> (‖ <em>idem</em>); <em>desbaratar, afligir</em>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 15:6\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.15.6\">2 Ch 15:6</a> com acusativo e <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּכָל־צָרָה</span> instrumental; com acusativo também <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 2:15\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.2.15\">Dt 2:15</a> (seguido de <span dir=\"rtl\">עַד תֻּמָּם</span>), <a data-ref=\"Esther 9:24\" href=\"/Esther.9.24\">Est 9:24</a> (seguido de <span dir=\"rtl\">לְאַבְּדָם</span>); provavelmente também <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:34\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.34\">Je 51:34</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אָכַל</span>), cf. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, הוּם\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_הוּם\">הוּם</a> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 7:23\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.7.23\">Dt 7:23</a>.",
