      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">הֶ֫רֶג</span></big>  <strong>substantivo masculino.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:25\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.25\">Is 30:25</a></sup> <strong>matança</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">ה׳</span> absoluto <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 24:11\" href=\"/Proverbs.24.11\">Pr 24:11</a> + 2 vezes + <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 26:15\" href=\"/Ezekiel.26.15\">Ez 26:15</a> (𝔊 Co <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶרֶב</span>); construto <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 27:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.27.7\">Is 27:7</a>—da matança dos inimigos dos judeus por estes <a data-ref=\"Esther 9:5\" href=\"/Esther.9.5\">Est 9:5</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אַבְדָֿ֑ן</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">מָטִים לַהֶרֶג</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 24:11\" href=\"/Proverbs.24.11\">Pr 24:11</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">לְקֻחִים לַמָּ֑וֶת</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּהֶרֶג הֲרוּגָיו הֹרָ֑ג</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 27:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.27.7\">Is 27:7</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ביום הֶרֶג רַב</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:25\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.25\">Is 30:25</a> (cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">ביום חֲבשׁ י׳ אֶת־שֶׁבֶר עַמּוֹ</span> versículo <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:26\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.26\">26</a>). <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 26:15\" href=\"/Ezekiel.26.15\">Ez 26:15</a> leia-se com 𝔊 Co acima.",
