      "html": "† I. <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">הָרָה</span></big></big>  <strong>verbo.</strong> conceber, engravidar <strong>(</strong>assírio <em>erû</em> cf. Dl<sup>Pr 21</sup> Muss. Arnolt Hbr <sup>Oct. 1890, 67</sup> Jäger<sup>BAS i. 473</sup><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  perfeito, 3.ª pessoa do singular masculino <span dir=\"rtl\">וְהָרָה</span> consecutivo <a data-ref=\"Psalms 7:15\" href=\"/Psalms.7.15\">ψ 7:15</a>; 3.ª pessoa do singular feminino <span dir=\"rtl\">הָרָ֑תָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 16:4\" href=\"/Genesis.16.4\">Gn 16:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 16:5\" href=\"/Genesis.16.5\">5</a>; 2.ª pessoa do singular feminino <span dir=\"rtl\">וְהָרִית</span> consecutivo <a data-ref=\"Judges 13:3\" href=\"/Judges.13.3\">Ju 13:3</a>; 1.ª pessoa do singular <span dir=\"rtl\">הָרִיתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 11:12\" href=\"/Numbers.11.12\">Nu 11:12</a>; 1.ª pessoa do plural <span dir=\"rtl\">הָרִינוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 26:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.26.18\">Is 26:18</a>; imperfeito <span dir=\"rtl\">וַתַּ֫הַר</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:1\" href=\"/Genesis.4.1\">Gn 4:1</a> + 26 vezes (<span dir=\"rtl\">וַתַּ֑הַר</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 16:4\" href=\"/Genesis.16.4\">Gn 16:4</a>); 3.ª pessoa do plural feminino <span dir=\"rtl\">וַתַּהֲרֶיןָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 19:36\" href=\"/Genesis.19.36\">Gn 19:36</a>; 2.ª pessoa do plural masculino <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּהֲרוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 33:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.33.11\">Is 33:11</a>; infinitivo absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">הָרֹה</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 15:35\" href=\"/Job.15.35\">Jb 15:35</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">הָרוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 59:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.59.4\">Is 59:4</a> cf. também versículo <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 59:13\" href=\"/Isaiah.59.13\">13</a> sob <strong>Poel</strong> abaixo; particípio feminino com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">הוֹרָתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 3:4\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.3.4\">Ct 3:4</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">הוֹרָתָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 2:7\" href=\"/Hosea.2.7\">Ho 2:7</a>;— <strong>1.</strong>  literalmente <em>conceber, engravidar</em> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 16:4\" href=\"/Genesis.16.4\">Gn 16:4</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 16:5\" href=\"/Genesis.16.5\">5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 19:36\" href=\"/Genesis.19.36\">19:36</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:21\" href=\"/Genesis.25.21\">25:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 38:18\" href=\"/Genesis.38.18\">38:18</a> (todos J), <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 11:5\" href=\"/II_Samuel.11.5\">2 S 11:5</a> (intervenção do homem expressa por <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 19:36\" href=\"/Genesis.19.36\">Gn 19:36</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">לְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 38:18\" href=\"/Genesis.38.18\">38:18</a>); geralmente na expressão <span dir=\"rtl\">וַתַּהַר וַתֵּלֶד</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:1\" href=\"/Genesis.4.1\">Gn 4:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:17\" href=\"/Genesis.4.17\">17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 21:2\" href=\"/Genesis.21.2\">21:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 29:32\" href=\"/Genesis.29.32\">29:32</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 29:33\" href=\"/Genesis.29.33\">33</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 29:34\" href=\"/Genesis.29.34\">34</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 29:35\" href=\"/Genesis.29.35\">35</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:5\" href=\"/Genesis.30.5\">30:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:7\" href=\"/Genesis.30.7\">7</a> (todos J), versículo <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:17\" href=\"/Genesis.30.17\">17</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:19\" href=\"/Genesis.30.19\">19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:23\" href=\"/Genesis.30.23\">23</a> (todos E), <a data-ref=\"Genesis 38:3\" href=\"/Genesis.38.3\">38:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 38:4\" href=\"/Genesis.38.4\">4</a> (ambos J), <a data-ref=\"Exodus 2:2\" href=\"/Exodus.2.2\">Ex 2:2</a> (E), <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 1:20\" href=\"/I_Samuel.1.20\">1 S 1:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 2:21\" href=\"/I_Samuel.2.21\">2:21</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 4:17\" href=\"/II_Kings.4.17\">2 K 4:17</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 7:23\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.7.23\">1 Ch 7:23</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 8:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.8.3\">Is 8:3</a> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 1:3\" href=\"/Hosea.1.3\">Ho 1:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Hosea 1:6\" href=\"/Hosea.1.6\">6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Hosea 1:8\" href=\"/Hosea.1.8\">8</a>, provavelmente também <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:17\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.17\">1 Ch 4:17</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">ותהר אֶת־מִרְיָם [ותלד]</span> cf. Be; ainda <a data-ref=\"Judges 13:3\" href=\"/Judges.13.3\">Ju 13:3</a>, e cf. pergunta de Moisés <span dir=\"rtl\">הֶאָנֹכִי הָרִיתִי אֵת כָּל־הָעָם הַזֶּה אִם־אָנֹכִי יְלִדְתִּיהוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 11:12\" href=\"/Numbers.11.12\">Nu 11:12</a> <em>concebi eu todo este povo, ou dei-o à luz?</em> Particípio feminino ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵם</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 2:7\" href=\"/Hosea.2.7\">Ho 2:7</a> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 3:4\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.3.4\">Ct 3:4</a>. <strong>2.</strong>  metaforicamente <span dir=\"rtl\">הָרִינוּ חַלְנוּ כְמוֹ יָלַדְנוּ רוּחַ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 26:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.26.18\">Is 26:18</a> de espera ansiosa e frustrada; <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּהֲרוּ חֲשַׁשׁ תֵּלְדוּ קַשׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 33:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.33.11\">Is 33:11</a>, de planejamento inútil, cf. Che; nos demais lugares de mal, iniquidade <span dir=\"rtl\">וְהָרָה עָמָל וְיָלַד שָׁ֑קֶר</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 7:15\" href=\"/Psalms.7.15\">ψ 7:15</a> (sujeito: homem ímpio), cf. <a data-ref=\"Job 15:35\" href=\"/Job.15.35\">Jb 15:35</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 59:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.59.4\">Is 59:4</a>, assim também versículo <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 59:13\" href=\"/Isaiah.59.13\">13</a>, leia-se <span dir=\"rtl\">הָרוֹ</span> (infinitivo absoluto) cf. Di.<br><strong>Pual</strong>  perfeito, 3.ª pessoa do singular masculino <span dir=\"rtl\">הֹרָה גָּ֑בֶר</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 3:3\" href=\"/Job.3.3\">Jb 3:3</a> <em>um homem foi concebido</em> (Bö<sup>ii p. 103</sup> Ba<sup>NB 77</sup> consideram como <strong>Qal</strong> passivo).<br><strong>Poel</strong>  infinitivo absoluto, <em>conceber, imaginar, arquitetar</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">הֹרוֹ וְהֹגוֹ מִּלֵּב דִּבְרֵי שָׁ֑קֶר</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 59:13\" href=\"/Isaiah.59.13\">Is 59:13</a>, mas leia-se antes <span dir=\"rtl\">הָרוֹ וְהָגוֹ</span> <strong>Qal</strong> infinitivo absoluto, ver acima. (Ba<sup> l.c.</sup> explica o texto massorético como <strong>Qal</strong> infinitivo passivo).—Acerca de <span dir=\"rtl\">הוֹרַי</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 49:26\" href=\"/Genesis.49.26\">Gn 49:26</a> ver <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, הוֹר\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_הוֹר\">הוֹר</a> e <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, הַר²\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_הַר²\">הַר</a> <strong>1 c.</strong>",
