      "html": "† II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">הָרָה</span></big>  <strong>adjetivo feminino: grávida</strong>—;absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">ה׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 16:11\" href=\"/Genesis.16.11\">Gn 16:11</a> + 10 vezes; construto <span dir=\"rtl\">הֲרַת</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 20:17\" href=\"/Jeremiah.20.17\">Je 20:17</a>; plural construto <span dir=\"rtl\">הָרוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Amos 1:13\" href=\"/Amos.1.13\">Am 1:13</a>; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">הָרוֹתֶיהָ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 15:16\" href=\"/II_Kings.15.16\">2 K 15:16</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">הָרֹתֵיהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 8:12\" href=\"/II_Kings.8.12\">2 K 8:12</a>;—<em>grávida</em>, como atributo, <span dir=\"rtl\">אִשָּׁה ה׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 21:22\" href=\"/Exodus.21.22\">Ex 21:22</a>; como predicativo <a data-ref=\"Genesis 38:24\" href=\"/Genesis.38.24\">Gn 38:24</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(לִזְנוּנִים)</span>, versículo <a data-ref=\"Genesis 38:25\" href=\"/Genesis.38.25\">25</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(לְאִישׁ)</span>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 4:19\" href=\"/I_Samuel.4.19\">1 S 4:19</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 11:5\" href=\"/II_Samuel.11.5\">2 S 11:5</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 7:14\" href=\"/Isaiah.7.14\">Is 7:14</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">וְיֹלֶדֶת</span>); na expressão <span dir=\"rtl\">הִנָּךְ הָרָה וְיֹלַדְתְּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 16:11\" href=\"/Genesis.16.11\">Gn 16:11</a> (acerca da semelhança com <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 7:14\" href=\"/Isaiah.7.14\">Is 7:14</a> cf. PetersHbr <sup>Apr. 1885, 243; Apr. 1886, 175</sup>), <a data-ref=\"Judges 13:5\" href=\"/Judges.13.5\">Ju 13:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 13:7\" href=\"/Judges.13.7\">7</a>; = substantivo <em>mulheres grávidas, mulheres que trazem filhos no ventre</em> <a data-ref=\"Amos 1:13\" href=\"/Amos.1.13\">Am 1:13</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 8:12\" href=\"/II_Kings.8.12\">2 K 8:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 15:16\" href=\"/II_Kings.15.16\">15:16</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:8\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.8\">Je 31:8</a>, e, em símile, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 26:17\" href=\"/Isaiah.26.17\">Is 26:17</a>; uma vez do ventre <span dir=\"rtl\">וְרַחְמָהּ הֲרַת עוֹלָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 20:17\" href=\"/Jeremiah.20.17\">Je 20:17</a>.",
