      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">הֵרָיוֹן</span></big>  <strong>substantivo.</strong>[<strong>masculino.</strong>] <strong>concepção, gravidez</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">ה׳</span> absoluto <a data-ref=\"Hosea 9:11\" href=\"/Hosea.9.11\">Ho 9:11</a> <a data-ref=\"Ruth 4:13\" href=\"/Ruth.4.13\">Ru 4:13</a>; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">הֵרֹנֵךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 3:16\" href=\"/Genesis.3.16\">Gn 3:16</a>, ou contraído, assim Ew<sup>§ 214 a</sup>, ou errôneo por <span dir=\"rtl\">הריונך</span> que consta no Sam., cf. Di;—<em>concepção</em>, em combinação <span dir=\"rtl\">מִלֵּדָה וּמִבֶּטֶן וּמֵהֵרָי֑וֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 9:11\" href=\"/Hosea.9.11\">Ho 9:11</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּתֵּן י׳ לָהּ ה׳ וַתֵּלֶד</span> <a data-ref=\"Ruth 4:13\" href=\"/Ruth.4.13\">Ru 4:13</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">עִצְּבוֹנֵךְ וְהֵרֹנֵךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 3:16\" href=\"/Genesis.3.16\">Gn 3:16</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">תֵּלְדִי</span>).",
